# W7h, c (k2), a stranger: takes the lobby gate to stag0101 during b's scene (its prompt answered with a's row: autochoice first),
# so its JOIN waits for the scene's end; it joins b while a's link still hangs (before @240). Before fix-021 its JOIN waited 30 s
# and became a NEW of its own (HoldExpired): alone in stag0101.
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@188
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control fail epoch>=@270
log c in stag0101
idle until present=3 fail epoch>=@240
log c joined while a was away
idle until epoch>=@335 fail stage=stagml11
log c stayed
